<title>UK: Laura Ashley takes control of distribution.</title>
<headline>Laura Ashley takes control of distribution.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>UK retailer Laura Ashley Holdings Plc said on Tuesday it is to take direct control of its distribution from Federal Express Corp.</p>
<p>The 371 FedEx staff, based at Newtown in Wales, will transfer to Laura Ashley and no redundancies are expected as a direct result of the transfer, the company said.</p>
<p>The group will pay about one million stg for taking over the distribution operations, including the purchase of fixed assets used in the business.</p>
<p>FedEx will continue to provide international air express services for the company.</p>
</text>
